    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<div class=\"spell-description\">\n  <p>\n      <strong>School:</strong>&nbsp;transmutation;\n    <br>\n    <strong>Level:</strong>&nbsp;Druid 1, Ranger 1;\n    <strong>Domain:</strong>&nbsp;Scalykind 1;\n    \n    \n    \n    <br>\n    <strong>Components:</strong>&nbsp;V, S, F, DF<br>\n    \n      <strong>Casting Time:</strong>&nbsp;1 standard action<br>\n    <strong>Range:</strong>&nbsp;touch<br>\n    \n    <strong>Target:</strong>&nbsp;living creature touched<br>\n    \n    <strong>Duration:</strong>&nbsp;1 Minute/Level<br>\n    <strong>Power Points/Spell Points Cost:</strong>&nbsp;1<br>\n        <strong>Saving Throw:</strong>&nbsp;Will Negates\n        <br>\n        <strong>Spell Resistance:</strong>&nbsp;yes<br>\n  </p>\n  <h2>Description</h2>\n  \n\n\n<p>\n<i>Magic fang </i>gives one natural weapon of the subject a +1 enhancement bonus on attack and damage rolls. The spell can affect a slam attack, fist, bite, or other natural weapon. (The spell does not change an unarmed strike’s damage from nonlethal damage to lethal damage.)\n</p><p><i>Magic fang </i>can be made permanent with a <i>permanency </i>spell.\n</p>\n<hr/>\n\n\n\n</div>\n"
    },
